<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Certificate of Residency - <%= @certificate_name %></title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; background: #e7e9ee; color: #111; font-family: "Times New Roman", serif; }
    .toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 16px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .toolbar button { border: 0; border-radius: 7px; background: #07349e; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; padding: 11px 18px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
    .certificate { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 8.5in; height: 13in; margin: 0 auto 24px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; padding: .72in .66in 1.08in; box-shadow: 0 10px 35px #0002; }
    .certificate::before { position: absolute; z-index: 2; inset: .55in .42in .85in; border: 3px double #26344b; content: ""; pointer-events: none; }
    .watermark { position: absolute; z-index: 0; inset: 1.95in 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: center; pointer-events: none; }
    .watermark img { width: 7.5in; height: 7.5in; object-fit: contain; opacity: .065; }
    .certificate-content, .council { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .letterhead { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9in 1fr .9in; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-align: center; }
    .letterhead img { width: .82in; height: .82in; object-fit: contain; justify-self: center; }
    .letterhead p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.15; }
    .letterhead .barangay-title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: 700; }
    .letterhead .captain-name { margin-top: 3px; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: 700; }
    .letterhead .captain-role { margin-top: 2px; font-size: 12pt; }
    .officials { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; margin: 19px 5px 14px; text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.12; }
    .officials strong { display: block; }
    .jurisdiction { text-align: center; line-height: 1.2; }
    .jurisdiction p { margin: 0 0 2px; font-size: 11pt; }
    .jurisdiction .city { font-size: 12pt; }
    .jurisdiction .barangay { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: 700; }
    .office-heading { margin-top: 14px; text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: 700; }
    .office-rule { height: 1px; margin: 5px 0 12px; background: #26344b; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: center; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: 700; }
    .salutation { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 16pt; }
    .body-copy { font-size: 15pt; line-height: 1.18; text-align: justify; }
    .body-copy p { margin: 0 0 22px; text-indent: 27px; }
    .filled { font-weight: 400; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
    .given-date { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 15pt; }
    .signature-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; min-height: .82in; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .dry-seal { width: .92in; height: .92in; object-fit: contain; }
    .signature-block { width: 2.75in; border-top: 1px solid #111; padding-top: 4px; text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; }
    .signature-block strong { display: block; font-size: 14pt; }
    .seal-notice { margin: 0 0 0 1.1in; text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: 700; }
    .council { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); grid-auto-rows: min-content; column-gap: 12px; row-gap: 12px; margin-top: auto; padding: 10px 3px 0; text-align: center; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.1; }
    .council strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; font-size: 10pt; }
    .council .sk { grid-column: 3; }
    .slogan { position: absolute; z-index: 3; right: .58in; bottom: .28in; left: .58in; display: flex; min-height: .77in; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid #344d91; padding: 5px 16px; color: #111; text-align: center; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; }
    @page { size: 8.5in 13in; margin: 0; }
    @media print {
      body { background: #fff; }
      .toolbar { display: none; }
      .certificate { width: 8.5in; height: 13in; margin: 0; padding: .72in .66in 1.08in; box-shadow: none; break-after: avoid; }
    }
    @media screen and (max-width: 850px) {
      body { overflow-x: auto; }
      .certificate { margin-left: 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="toolbar"><button type="button" onclick="window.print()">I-print ang Sertipiko</button></div>
  <main class="certificate" aria-label="Certificate of Residency">
    <div class="watermark"><%= image_tag "logo1.png", alt: "" %></div>

    <header class="letterhead certificate-content">
      <%= image_tag "logo3.png", alt: "Sagisag ng Barangay Kalikid Sur" %>
      <div>
        <p class="barangay-title">THE SANGGUNIANG BARANGAY</p>
        <p class="captain-name">NORMAN V. TACBIANAN</p>
        <p class="captain-role">Barangay Captain</p>
      </div>
      <%= image_tag "logo2.png", alt: "Sagisag ng Lungsod ng Cabanatuan" %>
    </header>

    <section class="officials certificate-content" aria-label="Mga opisyal ng barangay">
      <div><strong>NOLIE S. ISIDRO</strong>Barangay Secretary</div>
      <div><strong>NANCY B. BAUTISTA</strong>Barangay Treasurer</div>
    </section>

    <div class="jurisdiction certificate-content">
      <p>Republic of the Philippines</p>
      <p>Province of Nueva Ecija</p>
      <p class="city">CITY OF CABANATUAN</p>
      <p class="barangay">BARANGAY KALIKID SUR</p>
    </div>
    <div class="office-heading certificate-content">OFFICE OF THE BARANGAY CAPTAIN</div>
    <div class="office-rule certificate-content"></div>
    <h1 class="certificate-content">CERTIFICATE OF RESIDENCY</h1>

    <div class="certificate-content">
      <p class="salutation">To Whom It May Concern:</p>
      <section class="body-copy">
        <p>That I, NORMAN V. TACBIANAN, Punong Barangay of Kalikid Sur, Cabanatuan City, whose signature appears below do hereby attest the following facts:</p>
        <p>That, I know personally, <span class="filled"><%= @certificate_name %></span>, a resident/s of <span class="filled"><%= [@certificate_address&.purok && "Purok #{@certificate_address.purok}", @certificate_address&.house_number, @certificate_address&.street].compact_blank.join(", ").presence || "Kalikid Sur" %></span>, Kalikid Sur, Cabanatuan City, Nueva Ecija.</p>
        <p>That, <%= @certificate_profile.male? ? "he" : "she" %> is a legitimate, registered and bona fide resident/s of this community for more than <span class="filled"><%= @document_request.years_of_residency %></span> already.</p>
        <p>This Certification was issued upon the request of <span class="filled"><%= @certificate_salutation %> <%= @certificate_name %></span> for <span class="filled"><%= @document_request.purpose %></span> and for any legal purpose/s it may serve.</p>
      </section>
      <p class="given-date">Given this <span class="filled"><%= @certificate_issued_on.day %></span> day of <span class="filled"><%= @certificate_issued_on.strftime("%B") %></span>, <span class="filled"><%= @certificate_issued_on.year %></span>.</p>

      <div class="signature-row">
        <%= image_tag "logo3.png", alt: "Sagisag ng Barangay Kalikid Sur", class: "dry-seal" %>
        <div class="signature-block"><strong>Hon. NORMAN V. TACBIANAN</strong>Punong Barangay</div>
      </div>
      <p class="seal-notice">NOT VALID WITHOUT OFFICIAL DRY SEAL</p>
    </div>

    <section class="council" aria-label="Mga miyembro ng Sangguniang Barangay">
      <div><strong>Hon. HECTOR R. DIZON</strong>Committee on AGRICULTURE</div>
      <div><strong>Hon. JONATHAN C. YALA</strong>Committee on INFRASTRUCTURE</div>
      <div><strong>Hon. ROMMEL C. TACBIANAN</strong>Committee on ENVIRONMENTAL<br>PROTECTION</div>
      <div><strong>Hon. IMELDA R. TOLENTINO</strong>Committee on APPROPRIATION/<br>COOPERATIVE/CALAMITY<br>DISASTER PREPAREDNESS</div>
      <div><strong>Hon. FEBE D. PEREZ</strong>Committee on PEACE &amp; ORDER</div>
      <div><strong>Hon. NANCY A. CAPINPIN</strong>Committee on HEALTH &amp; EDUCATION</div>
      <div><strong>Hon. PAUL ADRIAN P. DELA CRUZ</strong>Committee on SPORTS &amp; YOUTH<br>DEVELOPMENT</div>
      <div class="sk"><strong>ASHANTI BRILLIANT P. VALLE</strong>SK CHAIRPERSON</div>
    </section>

    <footer class="slogan">KALIKID SUR, SAMA-SAMA PARA SA TUNAY NA<br>PAGBABAGO AT PAG-UNLAD!</footer>
  </main>
  <script>
    window.addEventListener("load", () => window.setTimeout(() => window.print(), 250));
  </script>
</body>
</html>
